.TH "RAPTOR-SCHEMA" 1 "2026-10" "RAPTOR Studio" "RAPTOR Studio Manual"
.SH NAME
raptor\-schema \- Print the JSON Schema of the .rbds format (the one `validate` and opening a file check against), for an editor or another validator.
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBraptor schema\fR [\-h] [\-o FILE]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Print the JSON Schema of the .rbds format (the one `validate` and opening a file check against), for an editor or another validator.
.SH OPTIONS
.SS Options
.TP
\fB\-o\fR, \fB\-\-output\fR \fIFILE\fR
write it to FILE instead of stdout
.SH EXAMPLES
.PP
Save the .rbds JSON Schema for an editor or another validator.
.RS
.nf
\fBraptor schema \-o rbds.schema.json\fR
.fi
.RE
.SH SEE ALSO
\fBraptor\fR(1)
